  "description": {
    "text": "The second yearly Pokémon TCG Holiday Calendar, released on 1 September 2023: 25 days of surprises, eight of them foil cards with a festive snowflake stamp. All eight reprint Sword & Shield series cards with their numbers: Alolan Vulpix V, Glaceon V and Glaceon VMAX, and five in cosmos holo, Pikachu among them.\n\nThe calendar also held five booster packs, seven three-card fun packs, two coins, two sticker sheets, a sidekick dangler of Pikachu and Glaceon and a code card for Pokémon TCG Live.",
    "sources": [
      {
        "title": "ICv2: Celebrate the Holiday Season with 'Pokemon TCG' (16 June 2023)",
        "url": "https://icv2.com/articles/news/view/54384/celebrate-holiday-season-pokemon-tcg"
      },
